0..76 Comment "// A recorded run carried along a path between its protocol\'s payload types:"
77..151 Comment "// each payload the protocol reads at the path moves by the path\'s forward"
152..228 Comment "// map, every move and every other payload kept. A run is a finite trace, so"
229..305 Comment "// it is covariant in every payload type, sent or received. The machine runs"
306..382 Comment "// the transport as a match on the run\'s moves, to the run conversion gives."
